WEBVTT

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.680
Gotta pee, gotta pee!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.650
Huh?

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.550
You saw... didn't you?!

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.730
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.660
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.870
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:12.440
<b>#03 Mahiro's Close Encounter</b>

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:14.580
Perfect.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.100
What's going on?

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.080
Save me, Mihari!

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:37.310
So, uh...

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.660
She and I were classmates 
back in middle school.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:44.190
I'm Kaede. Nice to meetcha!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.750
<i>She seems a little colorful 
to be one of Mihari's friends.</i>

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.330
<i>Is she one of those gyaru fashionistas?</i>

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:54.040
<i>Ugh, this is way outside my comfort 
zone as a home security officer!</i>

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.020
<i>If she were to find out who I really am...</i>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.340
You creep! Pervert!

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.790
You shut-in cross-dressing weirdo!

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:05.260
Oh god, oh god, oh god, oh god...

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.260
So what's your name?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.960
I-I-I'm, u-u-um...

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.470
Mahiro.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.370
Aww, she's shy! What a cutie.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.740
Hang on.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.200
You never told me you had 
a little sister, Mihari.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:20.700
Oh, well, you know? Family stuff.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.990
Mhmm, yup.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.580
Ah, gotcha, gotcha.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:28.840
Oh, that's right!

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:32.300
Sorry, Kaede. Would you mind 
keeping her company for a bit?

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.960
I still have a paper to 
finish up for college.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.640
Huh?

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.580
Man, getting into college 
early sounds rough.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:41.670
Sure thing! As a mere high 
schooler, I've got time to kill.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.140
You're the best!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.210
D-Don't leave me, Mihari!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:55.970
So...

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.890
What do you like to do in 
your free time, Mahiro-chan?

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:04.630
Uh! I like... reading manga 
and... p-playing games.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.440
You play games?! So do I!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.440
See? It's that puzzle 
game everyone's playing.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.090
Oh... I don't play that one.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.430
Oh, you don't?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.750
Never mind, then.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.920
I give up.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.490
Oh?

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.290
I guess it is about lunchtime, huh?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.100
Let's eat something, shall we?

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.600
I'll just whip something up from leftovers.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.470
You're gonna cook?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.770
I've actually got a little sister, too.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.900
So I cook for her all the time.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.970
I'm the domestic type, you know?

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.970
Do you cook, Mahiro-chan?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.620
I've never done it before.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.850
It's pretty easy. Watch.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.200
All right, let's dig in!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.150
Right.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:52.490
It's yummy!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.350
Really? I'm so glad!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.460
<i>It's weird, but...</i>

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.360
<i>this feels kinda nice.</i>

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.170
I'm so full.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.140
Same.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.280
Let's take the rest up to 
your sister later, okay?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.000
Okay.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:27.470
<i>I thought a gyaru would be 
more of a wild child.</i>

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.900
So, Mahiro-chan...

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.190
You've never done it before, have you?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:35.670
Wha?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.570
Maybe I could give you 
a little demonstration.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.510
<i>Scratch that! She's frickin' crazy!</i>

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:47.660
U-U-U-Uh! W-Wait! B-B-Back up!

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:51.030
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:55.510
Leave it to me. I'll take care good of you.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.130
Now, close your eyes.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.940
B-But I'm not...

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:02.610
Just try to relax.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.030
My head's gonna explode!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.450
There! All done!

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.340
See? You're all dolled up!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.710
<i>She was talking about make-up?!</i>

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.640
Mihari's not as into this 
stuff as I am, you know?

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.340
Sorry to disappoint.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.590
Even you had your bare-face era, Kaede.

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.010
Oh, no! Not that!

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:44.550
High school changed you, you traitor!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.220
Delete it!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.610
Not a chance!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.470
Oh, hang on!

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:50.820
I could show you how to 
coordinate an outfit, too!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.610
Can you take me up to your room?

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.530
Absolutely not!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.960
All right, I should head home.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.400
Bye-bye, Mahiro-chan.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:03.160
And thanks for having me, Mihari!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.790
Kaede's great with people, don't you think?

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:11.580
I thought she'd be good 
socialization practice for you.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.310
You could've told me.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:18.040
But you're right, she was pretty nice.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.340
She's kinda like...

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.420
the perfect big sister!

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:28.840
You could learn a lot from her, you know?

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.720
Mihari-oneechan.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:35.910
Huh?

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.660
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.140
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.620
<b>The Greatest Hit of the Century</b>

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.630
<i>The greatest hit of the century!</i>

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:53.920
Wait for me!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.810
It feels like I've known you for years.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.640
<i>But then fate tore them apart.</i>

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.400
I won't let you die here!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.990
Leonardo!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.600
Leonardo!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.580
<b>Titanic in Space</b>

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.570
<i>Titanic in Space.</i>

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.230
It's finally out!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.130
I wonder when they'll start 
streaming it online.

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:31.830
Oh, wait! I wanna go see this one, too!

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:36.590
It's a shame my duty as home 
security officer doesn't allow it.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.500
Why don't we go see it together?

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:40.990
Wha?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.850
<b>The Greatest Hit of the Century</b>

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:57.590
Where even are we? Isn't this a mall?

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.830
There's a movie theater upstairs.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.260
Ngh, the lively atmosphere! 
It burns my soul!

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:04.830
You're so dramatic.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.300
Hey, guys! Sorry I'm late!

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.720
Kaede-chan!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.350
It's nice to see you again, Mahiro-chan!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.510
Same here!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.710
'Kay, how 'bout we do a little shopping?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.380
Huh?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.010
P-Psst, what about the movie?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.400
Well, we kinda have some 
time to kill before it starts...

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.840
I've been tricked.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:25.790
Hurray!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.150
Hm?

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.250
I get to go on a date with Mahiro-chan!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.480
Wha? W-Wait a sec...

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:45.070
This hair clip would look 
great on you, Mihari.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.740
It's okay. I don't need one.

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:49.850
You sure?

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.380
Ugh, I'm exhausted.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.830
Going shopping for girl stuff 
really takes it out of you.

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:03.470
Yeah, great choices!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.430
Oh, shoot! I completely forgot!

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.170
Huh?

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.880
We gotta check out the bathing suits!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.770
We're not done yet?!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.880
Ta-da!

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:27.040
What d'ya think?

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:28.960
Whoa...

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.070
Y-You're stacked...

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.140
Oh, don't make me blush!

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.210
You too, Mihari! Let's see you!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:42.510
I haven't worn a swimsuit since 
gym class back in middle school.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.100
H-How do I look?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.130
You look amazing!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.280
It really suits her! Right?

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:50.910
Yeah, well, you know?

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.480
It was a tough act to follow.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.770
That reminds me.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.330
Didn't you say you wanted a 
swimsuit too, Mahiro-chan?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.900
Go and pick one to try on!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.380
Let's go!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.600
Gosh, it's perfect!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.120
You look adorable!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.110
I can't go out in public wearing this!

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:15.030
It's basically underwear, 
for crying out loud!

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.630
Then how about this?

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.820
You could also cover up with 
a beach wrap, if you'd like.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.230
Nnngh...

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:24.350
Why don't you try on a one-piece instead?

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.410
Yeah, I feel more comfortable in this.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.940
Then it's settled!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.130
Why did I even buy this?

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.960
I kinda bought one on impulse...

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.960
Hang on. I feel like we're 
forgetting something...

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.130
The movie!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.940
<i>They have returned!</i>

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.470
<i>The long-awaited next entry 
in the worldwide hit series,</i>

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:04.200
<i>"Clone Wars 7: The Battle Within."</i>

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:05.210
We made it!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.130
<i>This version of me just 
doesn't know when to quit.</i>

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.980
The AC's a bit strong in here, huh?

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.020
Look, it's about to start.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.720
I won't let you die here!

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.170
Leonardo!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.850
Nngh, I really need to go!

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.760
And right at the best part, too.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.340
I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:33.320
Okay.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.680
I'm a bit nervous about 
using the girls' bathroom.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:44.700
Wha?

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.380
What... the hell?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.960
<b>Titanic in Space</b>

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.400
I was sobbing!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.100
Me too!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.220
<b>Titanic in Space</b>

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.730
That last scene had me bawling.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.160
Why is it only the girls' bathroom?!

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:00.850
My eyes kinda hurt from crying so much!

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.210
<b>Titanic in Space</b>

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.030
I-I can't hold it much longer!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.040
Leonardo!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.840
Mahiro-chan? Are you in here?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:24.010
Oh, dear. So you didn't make it, huh?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.210
Don't worry. It's okay.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.940
Looks like you didn't get any on your skirt.

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.060
I'll go buy you a change of underwear, okay?

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.310
Do you think you can wait for me here?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.190
Yeah...

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.760
This'll be our little secret, okay?

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.890
What took you guys so long?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.630
The line was pretty long.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.470
Onee-chan...

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.970
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.520
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.970
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:12.970
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:20.400
Lunch sure is taking a while.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.270
Mihari better not be sleeping in.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:26.570
Jeez...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.290
Really not living up to the 
"Onee-chan" title now, are we?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.450
Hey, "Onee-chan"! What happened to lunch?

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:49.950
Oh, you're on your period. I've been there.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.280
I've got a cold, silly!

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.470
Oh, no! My bad!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.930
I'm fine.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.700
I took some medicine,

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.270
so I just need some rest.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:02.340
You'll have to make do with 
instant ramen for lunch.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.630
There's some in the cupboard—

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:06.670
Mihari...

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.740
Soy Sauce

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:13.060
Mihari's always staying 
up late writing reports.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.810
And she does all the housework, too!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.780
Ugh, what am I doing 
calling her "Onee-chan"?!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.520
She's your little sister, dammit!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:23.650
I can do this! For her!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.930
Besides, housework can't be that bad!

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.870
It's my duty as home security officer!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:31.760
I'll do a bang-up job and show her 
what a great big brother I can be!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:33.970
Oops...

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:39.370
They're a little soggy.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:49.870
Bleach or fabric softener? 
Non-alkaline or alkaline?

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.650
Who cares? It's all the same, right?

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:57.510
Anybody can use a vacuum!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.510
Oh, yeah. I should make 
Mihari something to eat.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.710
In times like this, nothing beats 
some homemade rice porridge!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.160
Rice porridge, huh?

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.680
Incoming Call

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.680
Mahiro-chan

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.630
Mahiro-chan?

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.590
Hm? What's up?

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.690
<i>How to make rice porridge?</i>

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.650
<i>It's really simple, actually!</i>

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.080
<i>But wait, does that mean 
Mihari's under the weather?</i>

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.270
<i>Is she okay? Should I come over and help?</i>

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.980
Oh, no, it's okay.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.320
I think I've got this. But thanks!

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.510
Easy now...

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.990
Now I put it on low heat 
and let it simmer, right?

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.770
Mihari

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:05.440
Hup.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.660
I made you rice porridge.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.630
What? You did?

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.570
I can't promise it's any good, though.

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.380
H-Hey! What happened?! What's wrong?!

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:34.020
I just... I can't believe... 
Onii-chan, you cooked for me!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:38.110
All right, already! Just eat 
it while it's hot, okay?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:39.620
Okay.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:50.250
It's so bland, but I'm so happy!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.530
I forgot to add salt.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.310
Change clothes before 
you go back to sleep, okay?

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.200
Okay.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.020
<i>Morning, Mihari-chan!</i>

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:19.760
Morning, Kaede!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:23.580
Wait. What's with the hair clip?

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.860
Oh, this?

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:29.350
My big brother gave it to me.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.840
He said it was a reward for 
doing so well on that test.

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:35.440
Aww, must be nice to have 
such a sweet older brother.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.710
Do you have any siblings, Kaede?

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.580
I have a little sister, actually.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.580
But honestly, we don't have much in common.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.220
Aw, that's too bad.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:46.780
But she's super cute all the same.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.960
I like baking cookies and 
stuff for her when I can.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.590
Wait, you know how to bake?

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:53.890
Teach me, teach me!

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:54.870
Of course!

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.810
We can bake at my place together sometime!

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.230
Hurray!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.570
Onii-chan...

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.980
Thank you.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.660
Perfect!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.390
Mihari

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.730
<i>My big brother was always so sweet to me.</i>

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:57.260
<i>But as time went by, he gradually 
stopped spending time with me.</i>

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:05.610
<i>I worked so hard at school and sports 
because I craved his praise so badly.</i>

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:10.280
Something smells nice in here.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:13.540
A-Are you sure it's okay for you to be up?

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.980
Yup, I'm all better now!

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.830
Look, I baked cookies.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.800
Sho good!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.690
You've always been so 
good at baking, Mihari!

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.940
Actually, this is a recipe 
Kaede taught me a while back.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.300
Oh, really? Wow!

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:36.590
<i>But we've gotten to talk 
a lot more recently.</i>

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:38.320
No wonder it tastes so good!

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.820
<i>In a way... it's just like old times.</i>

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.410
There's plenty more, okay?

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:42.570
Woo-hoo!

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.290
They're so good, I could eat them all day!

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:49.930
<i>Our roles are a little reversed, but...</i>

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:53.650
<i>I'd love it if we could stay like 
this just a little while longer.</i>

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:31.280
I take it all back!

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:33.800
Onii-chan?!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Episode: Mahiro's New Friend</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Illustration: Kay Yu</b>

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:39.870
<i>See you next time!</i>
